OL,5,G0325 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,6,     FSimon O'Brien and Henry Cole head 
OL,7,     Fto Middlesex and Surrey, where    
OL,8,     Fprojects include repurposing a    
OL,9,     F1950s hairdryer, updating a school
OL,10,     Fdesk and the restoration of a     
OL,11,     Fchild's motorbike.                
OL,12,G0415 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,13,     FOn the south coast, Henry Cole    
OL,14,     Fgets to work an aircraft fuel     
OL,15,     Ftank, while Simon O'Brien becomes 
OL,16,     Fobsessed with a 1960s speedboat.  
OL,17,G0500 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,18,     FSimon O'Brien repurposes an old   
OL,19,     Fbutcher's block into a coffee     
OL,20,     Ftable, while Henry Cole restores a
OL,21,     Fpair of go-karts to race against  
OL,22,     Frestorer Guy.                     
